        "created_at": "2014-05-31T16:42:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Glad you had a good time. I believe you will not be alone in groups that house rule things to ease into the real difficulty. As a matter of fact, I wish we had when my group played last weekend. I fear one of our members may have decided prematurely that it isn't for her because of the difficulty.</p>",
